0..63 Comment "//! A data type at a type argument that a family\'s body builds."
64..67 Comment "//!"
68..144 Comment "//! A signature can state the same data type. A type argument is a code, and"
145..223 Comment "//! the two codes quote the same type. One endpoint of its path is a call, and"
224..276 Comment "//! the two sides keep that call in different forms."
277..280 Comment "//!"
281..344 Comment "//! The checker converts the two codes as the types they quote."
345..421 Comment "//! `nestedComputed` builds the pair type in a family\'s body. `computedPair`"
422..500 Comment "//! states it in its signature. The path\'s endpoint `rungId Z` reduces to `Z`,"
501..579 Comment "//! so the two pair types agree. A closed endpoint and a function type without"
580..617 Comment "//! the pair around it agree as well."
618..621 Comment "//!"
622..638 Comment "//! - see: #5381"
639..716 Comment "//! - see: #5161 — the indexed family whose tail arguments hold such a type"
